      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# 🛡️ ClauseVader - Production AWS Infrastructure & Telemetry\n**Region:** `ap-south-2` (Hyderabad) | **AWS Account:** `575172595786` | **System Status:** 🟢 All Services Operational\n---\n*Real-time observability across API Ingress, Serverless Compute, Aurora PostgreSQL Serverless v2, and Encrypted S3 Storage.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 1,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "### 🌐 1. Edge & API Ingress Tier (`sco67rfosl` • clausevader-api)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "API Gateway Request Volume & Latency",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "region": "ap-south-2",
        "period": 300,
        "metrics": [
          [ "AWS/ApiGateway", "Count", "ApiId", "sco67rfosl", { "stat": "Sum", "label": "Total Requests", "color": "#1f77b4" } ],
          [ ".", "IntegrationLatency", ".", ".", { "stat": "Average", "label": "Backend Integration Latency (ms)", "yAxis": "right", "color": "#2ca02c" } ],
          [ ".", "Latency", ".", ".", { "stat": "Average", "label": "Overall Latency (ms)", "yAxis": "right", "color": "#9467bd" } ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 4,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "API Gateway Error Rates (4xx & 5xx)",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stacked": false,
        "region": "ap-south-2",
        "period": 300,
        "metrics": [
          [ "AWS/ApiGateway", "4XX", "ApiId", "sco67rfosl", { "stat": "Sum", "label": "Client Errors (4xx)", "color": "#ff7f0e" } ],
          [ ".", "5XX", ".", ".", { "stat": "Sum", "label": "Server Errors (5xx)", "color": "#d62728" } ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 1,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "### ⚡ 2. Serverless Compute Engine (AWS Lambda: `clausevader-backend`)"
